-- One-statement supplement generated from msg_products_with_parent_categories.csv.
-- Products map to pre-existing top-level catalogue categories; no categories are created.
-- Source subcategory labels remain in product tags for search, without subcategory assignments.
-- Blank stock -> 20; explicit zero stays 0. Blank MRP -> sale price.
-- Duplicate oil rows merge both image URLs; the conflicting ₹9 soya row is skipped.
